# Copy to secret_internal_api.env in this same folder and fill in a real
# value - generate one with:
#   python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
#
# Shared with mcp_server's own secret_internal_api.env (same value on
# both sides) - this authenticates service-to-service calls between
# chat_app and mcp_server (see src/internal_routes.py). There's no human
# session on those requests, so this token is the entire authorization -
# treat it like a password.
INTERNAL_API_TOKEN=
